This is the official version of Zeta++ Language by LUCIFER

For help type: zeta help : in the command prompt this will sort anykind of issue.

ZETA++ aka zpp is a high level language which is very much easy to make prototypes and also to make things easy to work.
This is a very reliable language as all the libraries are officially made by LUCIFER and CO. itself this makes the library very much updated.
Also this is the best the most fastest language you will ever find. 
there is a datatype of almost everthing and also no complex things also, there is a library for everything. Like from gui to 3d rendering
to even dsa, scripting and filesystem managment. currently you can find some very basic projects in the eaxmple folders and also there is a lot
to explore. 

JUST TYPE: zeta help. And we are there to help you out.